{"id":"va005","t":"V","lvl":1,"cat":"Verbo","q":"¿Estuviste en Zúrich el fin de semana?","a":"**Were** you in Zurich at the weekend?","note":"En EE. UU.: on the weekend.","hint":"Pregunta en pasado: Were + you…?","ref":"be"},
