{"id":"va008","t":"V","lvl":1,"cat":"Verbo","q":"¿Hay una llave dinamométrica libre?","a":"**Is there** a free torque wrench?","note":"torque wrench = llave dinamométrica.","hint":"Pregunta: Is there + singular?","ref":"there"},
