{"id":"va117","t":"V","lvl":2,"cat":"Verbo","q":"Si termino pronto, te ayudaré.","a":"If I **finish** early, I'**ll help** you.","note":"","hint":"If + presente, I'll + verbo","ref":"cond1"},
